1
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:31,120
What the heck?

2
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:36,720
Why are you on my bed?

3
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:43,440
This is clearly my bed, okay?

4
00:00:46,080 --> 00:00:47,320
This is really your room?

5
00:01:00,920 --> 00:01:02,240
Rent overdue.

6
00:01:02,720 --> 00:01:04,040
Bonus delayed.

7
00:01:04,320 --> 00:01:05,880
A reckless brother, offending the boss.

8
00:01:05,960 --> 00:01:07,800
And now I even have to take you in?

9
00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:11,559
Why does every unlucky thing

10
00:01:11,640 --> 00:01:14,480
happen to me?

11
00:01:19,520 --> 00:01:20,920
From now on,

12
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:24,000
I'm your lucky star.

13
00:01:25,320 --> 00:01:28,680
You, my lucky star?

14
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:29,880
That's all you're drinking?

15
00:01:30,240 --> 00:01:30,720
Come on,

16
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:32,000
drink more.

17
00:01:38,120 --> 00:01:40,520
Didn't expect you to have a decent figure.

18
00:01:40,560 --> 00:01:42,240
Don't test my limits.

19
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:46,560
How much did I drink?

20
00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:48,280
Wait a second!

21
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:50,640
No way, no way...

22
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:52,080
This is insane, insane, insane!

23
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:53,920
What kind of magic does this wine have?

24
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:56,760
It even made me, the almighty envoy, lose my memory.

25
00:01:58,160 --> 00:01:59,200
What happened last night?

26
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:01,160
Nothing happened last night.

27
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:08,160
I'm warning you,

28
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:09,560
you can't tell anyone.

29
00:02:09,640 --> 00:02:11,000
Nothing happened last night.

30
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:27,400
I actually established a connection.

31
00:02:28,960 --> 00:02:29,840
With her?

32
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:42,560
This is too awkward.

33
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:45,600
Qi Miao!

34
00:02:46,720 --> 00:02:47,880
Have some breakfast before you leave.

35
00:02:48,920 --> 00:02:49,680
I won't eat.

36
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:50,520
I'm going to be late.

37
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:51,680
I need to go now.

38
00:02:53,160 --> 00:02:53,760
Wait a second!

39
00:03:01,880 --> 00:03:03,120
What's this?

40
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:04,320
A lunch I prepared for you.

41
00:03:06,920 --> 00:03:07,640
Thank you.

42
00:03:16,520 --> 00:03:18,520
I can't believe that I, a proud envoy of Blue Star,

43
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:21,120
actually established a connection on a foreign planet.

44
00:03:21,640 --> 00:03:22,600
What should I do?

45
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:28,960
You're punctual.

46
00:03:29,920 --> 00:03:30,520
President Qin.

47
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:32,680
I won't make the same mistake twice.

48
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:33,400
Alright.

49
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:34,600
Let's get started.

50
00:03:34,920 --> 00:03:35,640
Mr. Qin.

51
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:37,640
This is the script I revised overnight.

52
00:03:37,720 --> 00:03:38,640
You can take a look.

53
00:03:39,320 --> 00:03:39,760
Okay.

54
00:03:41,200 --> 00:03:42,360
I'm the one who revised it.

55
00:03:42,480 --> 00:03:43,960
I won't back down this time.

56
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:44,960
Mr. Qin.

57
00:03:45,760 --> 00:03:47,200
This is my previous version.

58
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:48,680
I made some adjustments.

59
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:50,760
How about I explain it directly?

60
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:51,600
Sure.

61
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:52,600
I like straightforwardness.

62
00:03:52,640 --> 00:03:53,160
Go ahead.

63
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:58,200
Based on your habits during meetings,

64
00:03:58,880 --> 00:04:01,400
I'll start with market trends, audience preferences,

65
00:04:01,520 --> 00:04:02,880
and data analysis,

66
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:04,320
and explain my ideas step by step.

67
00:04:04,480 --> 00:04:05,280
Regarding market trends,

68
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:06,520
I noticed a few extremely popular shows on the market.

69
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:08,480
I observed them closely.

70
00:04:14,480 --> 00:04:15,000
Hello, bro.

71
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:15,760
Where are you?

72
00:04:16,880 --> 00:04:17,760
Alright, I'll be right there.

73
00:04:27,080 --> 00:04:28,080
Left alley is secure.

74
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:28,920
Confirmed.

75
00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:29,880
Copy that.

76
00:04:30,280 --> 00:04:31,320
Right alley is secure.

77
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:32,240
All clear.

78
00:04:44,960 --> 00:04:45,720
Where's the item I asked for?

79
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:46,560
Hold on.

80
00:04:49,880 --> 00:04:51,280
Careful, walls have ears. Got it?

81
00:04:52,280 --> 00:04:53,200
You're overacting.

82
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:53,920
Where's my crystal?

83
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:54,680
Right here, bro.

84
00:04:55,520 --> 00:04:57,240
Can't you show some respect for it?

85
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:58,080
Bro.

86
00:04:58,520 --> 00:04:59,520
Isn't this being low-key?

87
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:00,520
Hand it over.

88
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:06,520
The energy crystal.

89
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:07,640
Finally, I...

90
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:08,240
Bro.

91
00:05:08,640 --> 00:05:09,800
Then, the deposit...

92
00:05:10,960 --> 00:05:11,320
I'll give it to you.

93
00:05:11,640 --> 00:05:12,240
The rest...

94
00:05:12,320 --> 00:05:13,240
I'll pay you after the exhibition.

95
00:05:13,880 --> 00:05:14,440
Thank you, bro.

96
00:05:33,200 --> 00:05:34,120
Ruichi bro!

97
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:35,480
What brings you here?

98
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:38,960
I've been looking for you everywhere.

99
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:41,440
Didn't expect you to walk right into me.

100
00:05:43,760 --> 00:05:44,160
Bro...

101
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:45,920
You two know each other?

102
00:05:47,280 --> 00:05:48,360
I'll deal with you later!

103
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:52,280
Do I have to arrest you myself...

104
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:54,120
Or will you come willingly?

105
00:05:55,640 --> 00:05:56,160
Don't think for a second...

106
00:05:56,280 --> 00:05:58,000
That you're still the high and mighty Bluecore Envoy.

107
00:05:58,560 --> 00:05:59,920
Now the crystal's in my hands.

108
00:06:00,080 --> 00:06:01,760
If someone's getting captured, it's gonna be you by me!

109
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:08,840
What's going on?

110
00:06:13,400 --> 00:06:14,400
Oh my goodness!

111
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:16,000
What is going on here?

112
00:06:16,960 --> 00:06:20,240
You think a little trick like that can fool me?

113
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:27,560
Chasing you all the way from Bluecore to Earth...

114
00:06:27,880 --> 00:06:29,120
Why can't you just let me go?

115
00:06:29,440 --> 00:06:30,760
You stole the forbidden fruit...

116
00:06:31,320 --> 00:06:32,960
Breaking the laws of Bluecore.

117
00:06:33,520 --> 00:06:34,560
You've hurt people maliciously.

118
00:06:35,320 --> 00:06:36,760
The law demands punishment.

119
00:06:37,440 --> 00:06:39,080
I just ate some stupid fruit!

120
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:40,640
Do you really have to go this far?

121
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:44,960
Hao Ruichi...

122
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:46,160
Can't you just let me stay here on Earth...

123
00:06:46,280 --> 00:06:47,400
And live as an ordinary person?

124
00:06:48,080 --> 00:06:49,840
If you hadn't fled from Bluecore...

125
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:51,800
Would I have faced all these troubles?

126
00:06:52,240 --> 00:06:54,080
You can't run from the laws of Bluecore.

127
00:06:58,920 --> 00:06:59,920
You've linked...

128
00:07:03,320 --> 00:07:05,600
Never thought the esteemed Envoy...

129
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:06,640
Would form a bond...

130
00:07:06,720 --> 00:07:08,240
With the opposite sex on another planet.

131
00:07:09,200 --> 00:07:10,080
Hao Ruichi...

132
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:12,000
Just stay here with me obediently.

133
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:13,000
Enough nonsense!

134
00:07:13,640 --> 00:07:14,920
Get back to Bluecore now!

135
00:07:15,080 --> 00:07:16,280
I'd rather die...

136
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:17,320
Than return to that...

137
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:18,640
Cold and cruel Bluecore planet!

138
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:19,720
Just kill me.

139
00:07:22,080 --> 00:07:22,840
Alright.

140
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:26,120
I'll take away your consciousness right now.

141
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:36,080
You're out of energy.

142
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:37,920
Hao Ruichi.

143
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:40,160
You can't go back either.

144
00:07:40,320 --> 00:07:41,520
Stay here with me.

145
00:07:44,200 --> 00:07:45,280
Even if I have to fight,

146
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:47,840
I'll knock you unconscious,

147
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:49,240
and carry you back.

148
00:07:49,320 --> 00:07:50,000
Wait.

149
00:07:50,840 --> 00:07:51,520
Hao Ruichi.

150
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:52,640
Did you forget?

151
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:53,840
Did you forget your lifelong agreement with Lan Kexing?

152
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:55,280
the promise you made?

153
00:07:55,640 --> 00:07:56,560
If you leave,

154
00:07:56,840 --> 00:07:57,960
what about your other half?

155
00:08:04,400 --> 00:08:05,200
Hao Ruichi.

156
00:08:05,960 --> 00:08:08,160
You've already obtained the most precious thing.

157
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:09,760
Why

158
00:08:10,080 --> 00:08:11,600
do you still act like you don't care?

159
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:12,960
Hao Ruichi.

160
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:14,760
You're so cold-hearted.

161
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:18,280
A lofty emissary of Lan Kexing,

162
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:21,160
capable of seeing everyone's magnetic fields,

163
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:23,280
but unable to see through your own heart.

164
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:25,200
Hao Ruichi, oh Hao Ruichi,

165
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:27,280
you're truly pitiful.

166
00:08:43,040 --> 00:08:44,280
I'm sorry, Brother Ruichi.

167
00:08:44,760 --> 00:08:48,079
I really didn't know you weren't an Earthling.

168
00:08:48,599 --> 00:08:49,320
If I had known,

169
00:08:49,400 --> 00:08:50,760
I definitely wouldn't have been so reckless.

170
00:08:51,280 --> 00:08:52,600
Is that the point?

171
00:08:53,760 --> 00:08:55,280
I-I was wrong.

172
00:08:55,720 --> 00:08:58,000
I swear I'll never steal from you again.

173
00:08:58,560 --> 00:08:59,720
You're my only brother.

174
00:08:59,920 --> 00:09:01,320
From now on, I'll listen to you alone.

175
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:04,960
I had my reasons for doing what I did.

176
00:09:05,520 --> 00:09:06,480
Reasons?

177
00:09:06,560 --> 00:09:07,360
What reasons?

178
00:09:09,760 --> 00:09:12,240
I stole the crystals for my sister.

179
00:09:12,680 --> 00:09:13,360
Your sister?
